# Allowlist: this directory is a Hermes runtime profile full of state,
# caches and databases. Ignore everything, then whitelist only the
# files that define the Riskship agent.
*

!.gitignore
!distribution.yaml
!SOUL.md
!config.yaml
!mcp.json
!README.md

# Custom skills only (bundled Hermes skills stay out)
!skills/
!skills/severidad/
!skills/severidad/**
!skills/formato-ticket/
!skills/formato-ticket/**
!skills/deduplicacion/
!skills/deduplicacion/**

# Cron job definitions only (executions.db, locks and heartbeats stay out)
!cron/
!cron/jobs.json

# Helper scripts used by cron jobs
!scripts/
!scripts/*.sh
